I-ok now i made PickupReportService.cs (Service Layer)(in features preport folder)
which Handles business logic related to the Pickup Report feature.
it contains 1-ReportPickupAsync
Reports a pickup failure if the order is marked as Ready and the report is made within 30 minutes of the ready time.
2-CancelReportAsync:
Cancels the report if it was made within 20 minutes.
3- ApprovePickupAsync:
Approves a pickup report if it's within 30 minutes of the report time.(and follow the issue rules)
II-i also made PickupReportRepo.cs(in features preport folder)
which Manages the interaction with the database for the Pickup Report data
more ove it has some functions for adding, updating, and retrieving reports
III-PickupReportDto.cs(in DTOs folder in pickup-preport folder)
Includes properties like OrderId, ManagerId, Notes
IV-PickupReportController.cs(in features preport folder)
it expoces teh endpoints of the new feature 
POST /api/pickup-report/report: Reports a pickup failure.
POST /api/pickup-report/cancel/{reportId}: Cancels a previously reported pickup failure.
POST /api/pickup-report/approve/{reportId}: Approves the pickup report

V-IPickupReportRepo.cs(in features preport folder)
nterface of the repository layer
VI-Pickupmapper.cs(in features preport folder-in mapper folder)
it the newest consept for me as it Uses AutoMapper
to map between PickupReportDto and PickupReport objects.
so please review it carefully to make better enhancement in the future 